Overlay patch 0012 (rebased for pin 49c5312a): wire the iOS app shell
(app/ios/SohIosShell.m) into the game target and have LUS call it right
after SDL creates its window. The shell lives in the Ghostship-ios repo
(not vendor); its dir is passed as -DGS_IOS_SHELL_DIR. It grafts SDL's
UIWindow onto the active UIWindowScene, forces landscape, and hosts the
touch layer. rev2: rehomed hunk 2 — upstream inserted an __EMSCRIPTEN__
canvas-resize block right after SDL_CreateWindow.

